          %h2#firstorder_peano_arithmetic First-order Peano arithmetic
          %p
            Here we cannot
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantifier"} quantify
            over
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/subsets"} subsets
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/signature"} signature
          %p
            Thus, the signature of first-order Peano arithmetic consists of a constant
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mn 0
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} 0
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
